OL,3,GNEWSAReservoir road cattlegrid works   
OL,4,Adelayed by weather                     
OL,6,FThe closure of a key route which joins 
OL,7,Fthe Isle of Man's Mountain Road has    
OL,8,Fbeen extended until Friday due to poor 
OL,9,Fweather delaying refurbishment works.  
OL,11,FA section of the A14 Tholt Y Will Road,
OL,12,Fwhich connects the A18 to the northern 
OL,13,Fvillage of Sulby, has been closed since
OL,14,F15 November for the replacement of a   
OL,15,Fcattlegrid.                            
OL,17,FThe Department of Infrastructure said  
OL,18,Frain and wind on Snaefell for the past 
OL,19,Fweek had delayed completion of the     
OL,20,Fproject.                               
